---
title: "setAcceptedCapital (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: setAcceptedCapital(merkleRoot)
    q_check_auth --> q_check_root: caller == legionOperator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_root --> q_set_root: merkleRoot != bytes32(0)
    q_check_root --> q_revert_root: invalid root
    q_set_root --> q_emit: acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot = merkleRoot
    q_emit --> [*]: emit AcceptedCapitalSet(merkleRoot)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_revert_root --> [*]: revert InvalidMerkleRoot

    note right of q_set_root
        INV-001: only Legion operators determine accepted capital per investor
        INV-002: Merkle root enables withdrawExcessInvestedCapital verification
        INV-003: root can be updated (no immutability guarantee)
    end note
